<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<article xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook" xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" version="5.0">
  <title>Mathematics</title>
  <para>An inline equation <inlineequation><mathphrase>a + b</mathphrase></inlineequation> in prose.</para>
  <para>And one written in MathML:
  <inlineequation>
    <mml:math>
      <mml:mrow><mml:mi>x</mml:mi><mml:mo>+</mml:mo><mml:mn>1</mml:mn></mml:mrow>
    </mml:math>
  </inlineequation>.</para>
  <equation xml:id="pythagoras">
    <title>Pythagoras</title>
    <mathphrase>a^2 + b^2 = c^2</mathphrase>
  </equation>
  <informalequation>
    <mml:math>
      <mml:mfrac><mml:mi>a</mml:mi><mml:mi>b</mml:mi></mml:mfrac>
    </mml:math>
  </informalequation>
</article>
